							"font": "Arial;15;0",
							"parentStyle": false,
							"left": 54,
							"top": 1743,
							"width": 2217,
							"height": 42,
							"text": "Dashed arrow: client depends on supplier. Logical dependencies do not show execution sequence."
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLNoteView",
							"_id": "note-1171",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "UMLComponentDiagram-953"
							},
							"font": "Arial;15;0",
							"parentStyle": false,
							"left": 54,
							"top": 1803,
							"width": 1093.5,
							"height": 225,
							"text": "D01  Customer QR menu → Visit access and roles: Visit-scoped requests\nD02  Waiter POS → Visit access and roles: Waiter requests\nD03  Chef kitchen display → Visit access and roles: Chef requests\nD04  Cashier bills → Visit access and roles: Cashier requests\nD05  Management workspace → Visit access and roles: Manager / stock requests\nD06  Visit access and roles → Ordering: Authorized orders\nD07  Visit access and roles → Tables and waiter zones: Visits and zones\nD08  Visit access and roles → Kitchen operations: Kitchen actions\nD15  Ordering → Tables and waiter zones: Validate active visit\nD16  Ordering → Menu and availability: Validate dish / price"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLNoteView",
							"_id": "note-1172",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "UMLComponentDiagram-953"
							},
							"font": "Arial;15;0",
							"parentStyle": false,
							"left": 1177.5,
							"top": 1803,
							"width": 1093.5,
							"height": 225,
							"text": "D17  Ordering → Recipes: Snapshot requirements\nD18  Ordering → Inventory and suppliers: Reserve / release stock\nD19  Ordering → Kitchen operations: Accepted ticket\nD20  Ordering → Status and notifications: QR accepted event\nD21  Kitchen operations → Inventory and suppliers: Consume / waste\nD22  Kitchen operations → Status and notifications: Ready / progress event\nD23  Status and notifications → Tables and waiter zones: Resolve current waiter\nD24  Status and notifications → Waiter POS: QR / ready alerts\nD25  Status and notifications → Customer QR menu: Order progress\nD26  Status and notifications → Management workspace: Unassigned-zone fallback"
						}
					]
				},
