							"left": 62,
							"top": 1261,
							"width": 642,
							"height": 145,
							"text": "D10  Visit access and roles → Menu and availability: Browse / manage menu\nD12  Visit access and roles → Recipes: Manage recipes\nD13  Visit access and roles → Inventory and suppliers: Manage stock / suppliers\nD14  Visit access and roles → Prepared batches [optional]: Production if enabled\nD27  Menu and availability → Recipes: Per-portion needs\nD28  Menu and availability → Inventory and suppliers: Usable less reserved"
						},
