							"left": 712,
							"top": 1264,
							"width": 728.5,
							"height": 145,
							"text": "D29  Prepared batches [optional] → Recipes: Production recipe\nD30  Prepared batches [optional] → Inventory and suppliers: Raw out / prepared in\nD37  Menu and availability → Shared authoritative records: Catalog / prices\nD38  Recipes → Shared authoritative records: Recipe versions\nD39  Inventory and suppliers → Shared authoritative records: Stock ledger / suppliers\nD40  Prepared batches [optional] → Shared authoritative records: Config / batch history"
						}
					]
