							"font": "Arial;15;0",
							"parentStyle": false,
							"left": 206,
							"top": 1771,
							"width": 850,
							"height": 145,
							"text": "D04  Cashier bills → Visit access and roles: Cashier requests\nD05  Management workspace → Visit access and roles: Manager / stock requests\nD09  Visit access and roles → Bills and settlement: Bills and confirmation\nD11  Visit access and roles → Management analysis: View analysis\nD31  Bills and settlement → Ordering: Billable items\nD32  Bills and settlement → Tables and waiter zones: Close settled visit"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLNoteView",
							"_id": "note-1434",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "UMLComponentDiagram-1291"
							},
							"font": "Arial;15;0",
							"parentStyle": false,
							"left": 1072,
							"top": 1776,
							"width": 766,
							"height": 125,
							"text": "D33  Ordering → Shared authoritative records: Order snapshots\nD34  Tables and waiter zones → Shared authoritative records: Visits / assignments\nD35  Kitchen operations → Shared authoritative records: Ticket states\nD36  Bills and settlement → Shared authoritative records: Bills / settlement\nD41  Management analysis → Shared authoritative records: Read source records"
						}
					]
				}
